{"seq":2,"slug":"the-three-teachings","title":"The Three Teachings","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/the-three-teachings","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"confucian-engagement","title":"儒者的担当","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/the-three-teachings/confucian-engagement","wordCount":1658,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"buddhist-daoist-transcendence","title":"佛道的超脱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/the-three-teachings/buddhist-daoist-transcendence","wordCount":1597,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现苏轼融通儒、释、道三教的人生哲学。苏轼始终怀有儒者的担当——以天下为己任、正直敢言、造福一方，这是他人格的底色；同时，他又深刻地融入了佛、道的超脱智慧——道家的旷达、佛禅的解脱，给了他超越苦难、安顿心灵的力量。他出入佛老而归于儒，将三教智慧融会贯通，达到了既入世又超脱的圆融境界。本章揭示苏轼三教融通的崇高人生哲学。\n"}